(5703268, 829922, 47541, '<td valign="top">In what I''m calling the "<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=45475" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">rinac</a> challenge" this is my pick for her shot. There are a few that have the same style but this has the feel and tones of her work. If I''m wrong then take it as a compliment :)<br/> <br/>PS: not voting</td>', 'In what I''m calling the " rinac challenge" this is my pick for her shot. There are a few that have the same style but this has the feel and tones of her work. If I''m wrong then take it as a compliment :) PS: not voting', '2009-10-28 02:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
