(5707179, 829436, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I''m hoping it''s the camera and not the light source that was moved. Reminds me of the <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spirograph" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Spirograph</a> my brother had as a child.<br/>Just for fun, a <a href="//wordsmith.org/~anu/java/spirograph.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Java based Spirograph can be played with here.</a> <br/>Edit: Is this a <a href="//www.google.co.za/search?hl=en&amp;client=firefox-a&amp;rls=org.mozilla%3Aen-GB%3Aofficial&amp;hs=4hU&amp;q=camera+toss&amp;btnG=Search&amp;meta=&amp;aq=f&amp;oq=" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">camera toss</a> photo?</td>', 'Nicely done, I''m hoping it''s the camera and not the light source that was moved. Reminds me of the Spirograph my brother had as a child.Just for fun, a Java based Spirograph can be played with here. Edit: Is this a camera toss photo?', '2009-10-31 04:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
