(5709250, 829758, 108580, '<td valign="top">This is a complete toss-up for me. At first glance it merely looked like a high speed shot, but in retrospect you may have been panning and caught the swallow perfectly without any blur whatsoever. The solid white background of course prevents proving this explanation. I will give you the benefit of the doubt and score an 8 for a risky entry and OOB thinking and a good photo to boot (despite the zoomed out cropping, small subject). (SaraR ???)</td>', 'This is a complete toss-up for me. At first glance it merely looked like a high speed shot, but in retrospect you may have been panning and caught the swallow perfectly without any blur whatsoever. The solid white background of course prevents proving this explanation. I will give you the benefit of the doubt and score an 8 for a risky entry and OOB thinking and a good photo to boot (despite the zoomed out cropping, small subject). (SaraR ???)', '2009-11-01 17:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709767, 829856, 111474, '<td valign="top">I love this idea, particualy with the fluid S shape you made (I wish I could get that to work).<br/>IMHO it''s a pitty you have a bit to much light in the background for this photo to POP and a couple of the highlights are blown out on my screen.</td>', 'I love this idea, particualy with the fluid S shape you made (I wish I could get that to work).IMHO it''s a pitty you have a bit to much light in the background for this photo to POP and a couple of the highlights are blown out on my screen.', '2009-11-01 23:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
