(5712356, 829821, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how pen-like this looks. I also like the recognizable shapes in all that blur. I give you my yellow ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love how pen-like this looks. I also like the recognizable shapes in all that blur. I give you my yellow ribbon. ', '2009-11-03 17:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
