(5712646, 829784, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like it.  It''s like a tree being sucked up into a vortex.  Pretty cool.</td>', 'I like it.  It''s like a tree being sucked up into a vortex.  Pretty cool.', '2009-11-03 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712647, 829467, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice strong colors, but it ends up coming off to me as more of a shaky snapshot than an intentional effect. Sorry.</td>', 'Nice strong colors, but it ends up coming off to me as more of a shaky snapshot than an intentional effect. Sorry.', '2009-11-03 22:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712649, 830011, 67697, '<td valign="top">The blend of colors is pretty.  But with the extra softness, the movement is lost in OOF.  So I can''t tell if you moved the camera or took an OOF picture of some brightly colored painting :)</td>', 'The blend of colors is pretty.  But with the extra softness, the movement is lost in OOF.  So I can''t tell if you moved the camera or took an OOF picture of some brightly colored painting :)', '2009-11-03 22:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712650, 829822, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s like an abstract moment of passion.  Weird and intriguing.</td>', 'It''s like an abstract moment of passion.  Weird and intriguing.', '2009-11-03 22:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712651, 829514, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cool - it looks like the bat signal!</td>', 'Cool - it looks like the bat signal!', '2009-11-03 22:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712655, 829766, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the pastel look of this.  Very dainty.</td>', 'I love the pastel look of this.  Very dainty.', '2009-11-03 22:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712657, 828932, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off as an average snapshot, taken with harsh on-camera flash, I''m afraid. A couple of things that could possibly help:<br/>-Frame the image to avoid the clutter in the background, especially the wires under the table.<br/>-Find some way of diffusing or bouncing your flash. Of course, I don''t know what camera you have to work with, but any pop up flash can be diffused or bounced. (An index card taped in front of a pop up, and angled upward works nicely.)</td>', 'Comes off as an average snapshot, taken with harsh on-camera flash, I''m afraid. A couple of things that could possibly help:-Frame the image to avoid the clutter in the background, especially the wires under the table.-Find some way of diffusing or bouncing your flash. Of course, I don''t know what camera you have to work with, but any pop up flash can be diffused or bounced. (An index card taped in front of a pop up, and angled upward works nicely.)', '2009-11-03 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712658, 829893, 67697, '<td valign="top">It looks like a stream of white energy flowing thru the plants.  Very cool.</td>', 'It looks like a stream of white energy flowing thru the plants.  Very cool.', '2009-11-03 22:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712662, 830011, 70270, '<td valign="top">cool spacey colorful ... me like.  8</td>', 'cool spacey colorful ... me like.  8', '2009-11-03 22:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712663, 829296, 70270, '<td valign="top">great colors and diagonal lines, well titled.  8</td>', 'great colors and diagonal lines, well titled.  8', '2009-11-03 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712666, 829904, 70270, '<td valign="top">very nice; the tilt adds to the image.  7</td>', 'very nice; the tilt adds to the image.  7', '2009-11-03 22:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712667, 829296, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice title. (No vote, snarky comment only.)</td>', 'Nice title. (No vote, snarky comment only.)', '2009-11-03 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712669, 829792, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this comes off to me as more like an accidental shaky snapshot than intentional motion.</td>', 'I''m afraid this comes off to me as more like an accidental shaky snapshot than intentional motion.', '2009-11-03 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712670, 829708, 83313, '<td valign="top">A rubber tree plant?</td>', 'A rubber tree plant?', '2009-11-03 22:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712672, 829967, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was going to hit the 4 key and toss this off as just a shaky snapshot rather than intentional blur. Then I read the title and it all worked. I must disagree with the anti-title crowd. Sometimes the title makes all the difference in how a scene is perceived.</td>', 'I was going to hit the 4 key and toss this off as just a shaky snapshot rather than intentional blur. Then I read the title and it all worked. I must disagree with the anti-title crowd. Sometimes the title makes all the difference in how a scene is perceived.', '2009-11-03 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712674, 829758, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t see an evidence of camera movement. Either you missed the idea entirely, or it meets the topic in some subtle way that didn''t even rustle my hair on the way overhead.</td>', 'I don''t see an evidence of camera movement. Either you missed the idea entirely, or it meets the topic in some subtle way that didn''t even rustle my hair on the way overhead.', '2009-11-03 22:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5712677, 828933, 83313, '<td valign="top">I agree! We have had lots of rock song challenges, and it is time for some country music. With the number of country songs that mention Fort Worth and Dallas, it would be a freestudy for me!<br/> <br/>Not totally sure if this displays camera movement or not. Perhaps pretty subtle motion around the flames?</td>', 'I agree! We have had lots of rock song challenges, and it is time for some country music. With the number of country songs that mention Fort Worth and Dallas, it would be a freestudy for me! Not totally sure if this displays camera movement or not. Perhaps pretty subtle motion around the flames?', '2009-11-03 22:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
