(5714404, 829837, 63218, '<td valign="top">Haha a 5.4 is not bad. I''m looking at your settings w/interest.  I usually shoot these while driving home at night after work. Looks to me like maybe your streets were wet &amp; the shutter was open long enuf for you to pass under the green light. Anyway, I was one of your 10''s. Please do some more! I am a big fan of these.</td>', 'Haha a 5.4 is not bad. I''m looking at your settings w/interest.  I usually shoot these while driving home at night after work. Looks to me like maybe your streets were wet & the shutter was open long enuf for you to pass under the green light. Anyway, I was one of your 10''s. Please do some more! I am a big fan of these.', '2009-11-04 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5714406, 829936, 63218, '<td valign="top">Well done. Hope you find a chance to do some more of these. These are so beautiful.</td>', 'Well done. Hope you find a chance to do some more of these. These are so beautiful.', '2009-11-04 17:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5714410, 829979, 63218, '<td valign="top">The oncoming headlights can be a problem. I might be nuts, but I don''t see overexposure, I see white light. High energy, like lightening.</td>', 'The oncoming headlights can be a problem. I might be nuts, but I don''t see overexposure, I see white light. High energy, like lightening.', '2009-11-04 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5714415, 830013, 63218, '<td valign="top">What can I say, I love everything about this. So romantic &amp; mysterious. The black area was the inspired perfect touch, you have a comp that''s centered &amp; not centered at the same time.</td>', 'What can I say, I love everything about this. So romantic & mysterious. The black area was the inspired perfect touch, you have a comp that''s centered & not centered at the same time.', '2009-11-04 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5714434, 829572, 63218, '<td valign="top">If you want to have some more fun, replace the black cloth with a couple of reflecting surfaces. Wrinkled silver mylar is perfect. I love this. The centralized starting-point adds the illusion of a focal point &amp; the colors are energetic. more! we want more!</td>', 'If you want to have some more fun, replace the black cloth with a couple of reflecting surfaces. Wrinkled silver mylar is perfect. I love this. The centralized starting-point adds the illusion of a focal point & the colors are energetic. more! we want more!', '2009-11-04 18:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5714438, 828906, 63218, '<td valign="top">Don''t you like the strobe effect on the light trails? I do, but I don''t know why it happens, exactly, except that it seems to have something to do with how fast you''re moving the camera. Very nice.</td>', 'Don''t you like the strobe effect on the light trails? I do, but I don''t know why it happens, exactly, except that it seems to have something to do with how fast you''re moving the camera. Very nice.', '2009-11-04 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
