(5715340, 829766, 30982, '<td valign="top">What Colleen said!  The pastels are lovely, and the created softness/composition combo complement (compliment?) the pastel feel as well.  While the red of the Posthumous seems a bit garish, it is a nice token.  Just don''t place it too close to the photograph.  :-)</td>', 'What Colleen said!  The pastels are lovely, and the created softness/composition combo complement (compliment?) the pastel feel as well.  While the red of the Posthumous seems a bit garish, it is a nice token.  Just don''t place it too close to the photograph.  :-)', '2009-11-05 12:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5715373, 830000, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a clever idea, the whole swinging thing!  As for the "happy little trees" - eh, kinda.  But isn''t there supposed to be a little pond or stream or something?</td>', 'What a clever idea, the whole swinging thing!  As for the "happy little trees" - eh, kinda.  But isn''t there supposed to be a little pond or stream or something?', '2009-11-05 13:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5715375, 829707, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think it quite intriguing that your house is standing still amidst all that movement.  Very clever, you are!  Combine this one with a few others you have and you''ve got an entire horror story in stills.</td>', 'I think it quite intriguing that your house is standing still amidst all that movement.  Very clever, you are!  Combine this one with a few others you have and you''ve got an entire horror story in stills.', '2009-11-05 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 0),
